  "description": "The coincident-plane branch of theorem6: ONE shared alpha=beta plane patch, with separate a1/b1 at B1 and a/b at B. A clean polygon and exact corresponding directions are modern regularization, not source pixel measurements. No second plane, c/M apparatus, or shared crossing of the two pairs is added.",
